OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after criminal activity on
OL,4,Ahigh streets targeted
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 43,000 illegal cigarettes and
OL,7,Fan 850-plant cannabis farm have been
OL,8,Fseized as part of a joint operation by
OL,9,Fpolice, HM Revenue & Customs (HMRC) and
OL,10,Ftrading standards officers on
OL,11,FMerseyside high streets.
OL,13,FPolice arrested seven people for
OL,14,Fvarious drug, theft and bail offences
OL,15,Fon the Wirral as part of the operation,
OL,16,Fan HMRC spokesperson said.
OL,18,FThey said unannounced visits were made
OL,19,Fto eight shops across Liverpool,
OL,20,FHuyton, Birkenhead and Wallasey, as
OL,21,FHMRC scaled-up work to tackle illegal
OL,22,Fhigh street activity.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
