OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after criminal activity on
OL,4,Ahigh streets targeted
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was part of UK-wide investigations
OL,7,Ftargeting those using vape shops,
OL,8,Fbarbers, souvenir shops, candy and
OL,9,Fconvenience stores as fronts for money
OL,10,Flaundering and tax crime, they added.
